    measurement='No isolated read/write latency, throughput or durability benchmark is recorded. Share counts are a conformance result. Suite counts measure test execution, not performance.',
    benchmark='Proposed: vary payload size, missing-share count and cold/warm cache; report read/write p50/p95, bytes stored and reconstruction CPU on fixed hardware.',
